ators/new"}],"parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"czloL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e56d9aa9-077c-4358-abb7-cac7efb2efeb","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"いやでも `t.prototype.constructor()` で呼ぶと `new` を介して呼べって怒られるんだよな...","ts":"1626277421.005800","thread_ts":"1626276145.496200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eog6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4970c2b8-b37a-4d8a-bada-96c8c3cbac76","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"```class A {\n  constructor() {\n    console.log(\"constructor()\");\n  }\n  hoge() {\n    console.log(\"hoge()\");\n  }\n}\nconst a = (T: new () =\u0026gt; A) =\u0026gt; {\n  const t = new T()\n  t.hoge()\n};\na(A) // -\u0026gt; \"hoge()\"```\nこう言う話でしょうか？","ts":"1626277886.007100","thread_ts":"1626276145.496200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RG0dt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88b23ee5-e180-43cc-af82-2a3a3e27f2f1","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"おおー、まさに!\nありがとうございます","ts":"1626278083.008400","thread_ts":"1626276145.496200","parent_user_id":"UG6DF6W87","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A5EV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e720949f-ef89-447d-934d-3050031f949d","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"\u003chttps://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/classes.html#abstract-construct-signatures\u003e\nこれかー","ts":"1626278102.008900","thread_ts":"1626276145.496200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Documentation - Classes","id":1,"title":"Documentation - Classes","title_link":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/2/classes.html#abstract-construct-signatures","text":"How classes work in TypeScript","blocks":null,"service_name":"typescriptlang.org","service_icon":"https: